llCredit":false},{"lineNumber":16,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"1. Treat the current repository as the target unless the user identifies another repository.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":17,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"2. Use `HEAD` as the before point and `WORKTREE` as the after point unless the user specifies comparison points. `WORKTREE` includes staged, unstaged, and untracked (but not ignored) files.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":18,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"3. Write to `_temp/visual-diff.html` unless the user supplies an output path.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":19,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"4. Run the bundled generator from the repository root:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":21,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"   ```bash","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"   python3 .codex/skills/present-changes-visually/scripts/generate-split-view-diff.py \\","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"     . HEAD WORKTREE _temp/visual-diff.html","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"   ```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T15:53:32","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"WesleyTay25"},"content":"   Replace `HEAD`, `WORKTREE`, and the output path with the requested values. The comparison points can